cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
title: "PoET²S simulator: discrete-event simulator for twin-trust-weighted validator selection"
abstract: >-
  Discrete-event simulator and per-seed outputs accompanying the revised
  manuscript "PoET²S: Folding a Digital Twin into Validator Selection for
  Blockchain Consensus in Peer-to-Peer Energy Trading". It implements PoET²S,
  three twin-based design points (veto, additive, linear) and seven classical
  baselines (PoW, PoS, PBFT, DPoS and their +Twin variants) as message-passing
  state machines.
